{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.184, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 22, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:22.789Z", "t_ms": 5131, "delta": "ion agent stores and uses its self-reflections as follows:\n\n* **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.383, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 23, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:22.988Z", "t_ms": 5330, "delta": "Where they are kept:** Self-reflections ($sr_t$) are stored in an episodic memory buffer ($mem$), which"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.694, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:23.214Z", "t_ms": 5556, "delta": " acts as the agent's long-term memory [C1, C4]. After each trial $t$, the newly"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.851, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:23.458Z", "t_ms": 5800, "delta": " generated self-reflection is appended to this memory [C2, C5]. To stay within large language model (LLM)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.098, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:23.682Z", "t_ms": 6024, "delta": " context limits, this memory buffer is practically bounded by a maximum capacity ($\\Omega$), typically set to 1\u20133 stored"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.347, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:23.930Z", "t_ms": 6272, "delta": " experiences [C5].\n* **How they are used:** The Actor model treats the stored self-reflections as in"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.587, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:24.190Z", "t_ms": 6532, "delta": "-context memory, conditioning its future decisions on both short-term memory (the current trajectory history) and long-term memory (the past"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.749, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:24.352Z", "t_ms": 6694, "delta": " self-reflections) [C2, C3, C4]. This linguistic feedback allows the agent to learn from past errors and adapt its"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.011, "data": {"request_id": "6556491f76dc", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:24.619Z", "t_ms": 6961, "delta": " decision-making in subsequent trials\u2014such as choosing alternative actions\u2014without updating model weights [C1, C3, C4]."}}
